'''Blaster''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Futuristic Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|Gamepass]] has since went off sale.  

== Appearance ==
Blaster has a solid black handle, tip, and barrel while it has blue streaks on the entire weapon. it also has the letters and numbers 'TX-08' on it. 

== Trivia ==
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/92628074/Orinthian-Blaster-3777 Orinthian Blaster 3777], purchasable from the avatar shop for 825 Robux.
*Upon purchasing the [[Futuristic Item Pack]], players would receive this gun, the godly knife [[Virtual]] and the godly pet [[Electro]].
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Virtual]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Virtual Set|Virtual Set]], and with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Electro]], making the Full Virtual Set.
*When salvaged, it provides 70 godly [[Shards|shards]].
*This, [[Evergun]], and [[Chroma Evergun]] are the only guns in the game to not have a trigger guard.

